Package: pve-gic-manager
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, systemd
Maintainer: Phytium Virtualization Team <support@phytium.com.cn>
Description: Proxmox VE ARM64 GIC Management Web and API Service
 A dedicated web management interface and cluster API service for controlling
 and diagnosing ARM64 QEMU GIC (Generic Interrupt Controller) versions on Proxmox VE 9.
 .
 Features:
  - Port 8005: Proxmox VE 9 styled Web Management UI
  - Port 8004: Inter-Node authenticated REST API
  - GICv2 marked in Red, GICv3 marked in Green
  - Node and VM real-time IP discovery
  - Automatic cluster-wide VM synchronization
  - Batch and single VM GIC version reconfiguration
